  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Let&apos;s support Choco-Colombia in this emergency</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The torrential rains and flash flooding caused by Hurricane Iota have hit Choco, a jungle province in Colombia with a history of extreme poverty and situations extremely hard.    As Quarry Lane School&apos;s Spanish Club, we strive to raise money and awareness for humanitarian crises all over the world. We believe that by partnering with TECHO, an organization that brings people together to lift Latin American communities out of poverty, we&apos;ll be able to really make a difference in Choco.</narrative>
  </description>
